  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2301.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2301.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to consumer products sold, offered for sale, or otherwise distributed in New Hampshire that are subject to the product ban in RSA 149-M:64, IV.\n\nSource. #14658, eff 7-18-26, EXPIRES: 7-18-36",
